<!--
  <summary>
  The three faces of DialogGameControllers.xml, one include each, pulled
  in by Includes.xml. Kodi reuses that one window file for controller
  configuration, port setup and the players dialog and tells them apart
  with Window.IsDialogTopMost, so the window file holds three conditional
  includes and the controls live here. Games are outside this skin's scope;
  these exist so Settings, Input, Configure attached controllers opens
  something rather than nothing.
